flowchart TD
  DOM[Completed ChatGPT response DOM] --> Extract[Semantic extraction]
  Extract --> IR[ResponseIR]
  IR --> Facts[Deterministic table facts]
  Facts --> Rules[Rules / Literal]
  Facts --> Gemma[Optional Gemma via local Ollama]
