  Validate --> Plan[NarrationPlan]
  Plan --> Queue[Segment audio queue]
  Queue --> Kokoro[Kokoro.js local WASM synthesis]
  Kokoro --> Audio[Browser audio playback]
  Panel[Chrome side panel: inspector + controls] -. hosts / controls .-> Plan
  Panel -. controls .-> Queue
